Linux platform support for iPlug2 (X11 window, GLX/NanoVG GL3, CLAP posix-fd/timer and
VST3 X11 embedding), from upstream iPlug2 PR #1336 by RangerRick (MIT, as iPlug2).
Source: https://github.com/iPlug2/iPlug2/pull/1336
Commit: 03d3c1af13d3456b09df1e94800dc48546f3aaef
Rebased onto the pinned d54f690 after the iplug2-clap-* patches, which keep their
contract-tested CLAP state-write and value-to-text code. CI, documentation, presets and
ReaperExt changes are omitted. setup-deps.py applies it on Linux only.

